      "ok": null,
      "detail": "`sensor_baro_sim`：气压 = f(EKF `vehicle_global_position.alt`) + 1 Pa RMS 噪声（`src/modules/simulation/sensor_baro_sim/SensorBaroSim.cpp:107-118`、`:154-155`；`_baro_drift_pa_per_sec` 默认 0）；`sensor_gps_sim`：lat/lon = EKF + N(0, 0.2 m)、alt = EKF + N(0, 0.5 m)、v = EKF v + σ(0.06, 0.077, 0.158)（`src/modules/simulation/sensor_gps_sim/SensorGpsSim.cpp:117-121`）。⟹ 这台 SITL 上，EKF 的位置/高度**没有任何一路来自 SIH 真值**：助航是自反馈，误差不落地、也没人能纠它",
